+| Clarity / flow | 8/10 | Chapter 10, the first three hounds cross from the far beach; Chapter 11, Cael inventories the remaining three and induces the cut dog to move first | The physical logic ultimately resolves, and the later analysis validates what occurred. On first pass, however, the labels “near,” “far,” “head,” and “tail,” plus several subjects referred to as “the one” or “the two,” briefly tax spatial memory at the exact moment the tactical state changes fastest. | High |
