+| Keep reading | 9/10 | Chapter 9 ending, the five-person plan and vote; Chapter 13, discovery of “quiet ground”; Chapter 14, the blank tack | The movement supplies a complete investigation-and-clearance arc while maintaining serial pressure through Teague, the quiet ground, Cael's grandmother, and the next slip. The three-chapter denouement slightly relaxes momentum, but its character payoffs retain attention. | High |
